{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-05-25 14:27:00', 'title': 'EY ANNOUNCES SEAN MINTER, CEO AND FOUNDER OF AMPLIFAI, AS AN ENTREPRENEUR OF THE YEAR® 2023 SOUTHWEST AWARD FINALIST', 'text': 'PLANO, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CX--ERNST & YOUNG LLP (EY US) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CEO AND FOUNDER, SEAN MINTER OF AMPLIFAI WAS NAMED AN ENTREPRENEUR OF THE YEAR® 2023 SOUTHWEST AWARD FINALIST. THIS IS THE SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR THAT MINTER HAS BEEN SELECTED AS A FINALIST FOR THIS PRESTIGIOUS AWARD, WHICH RECOGNIZES TRANSFORMATIVE ENTREPRENEURS AND LEADERS OF HIGH-GROWTH COMPANIES WHO ARE BUILDING A MORE EQUITABLE, SUSTAINABLE, AND PROSPEROUS WORLD FOR ALL. MINTER WAS SELECTED BY AN INDEPENDENT.'}